But here is the twist.

284
00:10:21,565 --> 00:10:23,246
For a Chiron owner,

285
00:10:23,246 --> 00:10:26,255
fuel is one of the smallest costs.

286
00:10:26,435 --> 00:10:28,304
Let's do a simple example.

287
00:10:28,484 --> 00:10:31,441
If an owner drives one thousand miles

288
00:10:31,441 --> 00:10:33,359
a year at ten and a half

289
00:10:33,359 --> 00:10:34,718
miles per gallon,

290
00:10:34,718 --> 00:10:37,436
that is about ninety-five gallons.

291
00:10:37,616 --> 00:10:39,550
Even at five dollars a gallon,

292
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:41,872
that is under five hundred dollars a

293
00:10:41,872 --> 00:10:44,129
year, less than a single brake pad.

294
00:10:44,479 --> 00:10:46,032
That example is ours,

295
00:10:46,032 --> 00:10:47,881
with a simple assumption,

296
00:10:47,881 --> 00:10:50,248
but it shows the strange math of

297
00:10:50,248 --> 00:10:51,654
hypercar ownership.

298
00:10:51,834 --> 00:10:53,590
The more expensive the car,

299
00:10:53,590 --> 00:10:55,282
the less the fuel matters.

300
00:10:55,462 --> 00:10:56,994
What matters is time.

301
00:10:57,174 --> 00:10:59,603
Every year a car like this exists,

302
00:10:59,603 --> 00:11:00,818
it needs service,

303
00:11:00,818 --> 00:11:02,461
insurance, and storage,

304
00:11:02,461 --> 00:11:04,175
whether it moves or not.

305
00:11:04,525 --> 00:11:06,870
Storage is part of the cost.

306
00:11:07,050 --> 00:11:10,621
Most owners keep these cars in climate-controlled

307
00:11:10,621 --> 00:11:13,900
garages, with battery tenders and car covers.

308
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,928
The Singapore estimate even listed a yearly

309
00:11:16,928 --> 00:11:18,981
upkeep figure for a car that is

310
00:11:18,981 --> 00:11:20,173
not driven at all,

311
00:11:20,173 --> 00:11:22,955
of about one hundred five thousand dollars

312
00:11:22,955 --> 00:11:24,279
per fourteen months,

313
00:11:24,279 --> 00:11:26,862
though again it was a rough conversion.

314
00:11:27,213 --> 00:11:28,768
Then there is transport.

315
00:11:28,948 --> 00:11:31,732
Many owners move their cars on enclosed

316
00:11:31,732 --> 00:11:32,946
trucks to events,

317
00:11:32,946 --> 00:11:34,944
tracks, and service centers,

318
00:11:34,944 --> 00:11:36,657
instead of driving them.

319
00:11:36,837 --> 00:11:37,929
And there is care.

320
00:11:38,109 --> 00:11:41,947
The Singapore estimate said the manufacturer advises

321
00:11:41,947 --> 00:11:43,424
against jet washing,

322
00:11:43,424 --> 00:11:45,933
and listed a full repaint at about

323
00:11:45,933 --> 00:11:48,000
fifty-five thousand dollars.

324
00:11:48,351 --> 00:11:49,651
Here is the twist.

325
00:11:49,831 --> 00:11:52,975
Some of these costs exist because owners

326
00:11:52,975 --> 00:11:54,626
are protecting value.

327
00:11:54,806 --> 00:11:56,843
A Chiron with low mileage,

328
00:11:56,843 --> 00:12:00,054
perfect paint, and a full service history

329
00:12:00,054 --> 00:12:01,934
is worth more when sold.

330
00:12:02,114 --> 00:12:04,465
So many owners treat the car less

331
00:12:04,465 --> 00:12:07,813
like transportation and more like an investment

332
00:12:07,813 --> 00:12:10,520
that they also get to drive sometimes.

333
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,867
And that brings us to the biggest

334
00:12:12,867 --> 00:12:13,412
surprise.

335
00:12:13,592 --> 00:12:15,840
Most cars lose value the moment they

336
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,901
leave the dealer.

337
00:12:17,081 --> 00:12:19,658
The Chiron often did the opposite.

338
00:12:19,838 --> 00:12:21,937
In November twenty seventeen,

339
00:12:21,937 --> 00:12:24,543
evo reported that a used Chiron with

340
00:12:24,543 --> 00:12:27,799
about one thousand three hundred thirty miles

341
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:30,477
was being offered for three point six

342
00:12:30,477 --> 00:12:33,661
million pounds, against an original price of

343
00:12:33,661 --> 00:12:36,267
about two point five million pounds.

344
00:12:36,617 --> 00:12:37,687
The next month,

345
00:12:37,687 --> 00:12:39,757
in December twenty seventeen,

346
00:12:39,757 --> 00:12:42,541
the first Chiron ordered for the United

347
00:12:42,541 --> 00:12:45,181
States sold at RM Sotheby's for three

348
00:12:45,181 --> 00:12:49,107
million seven hundred seventy-two thousand five hundred

349
00:12:49,107 --> 00:12:49,678
dollars.

350
00:12:49,858 --> 00:12:52,019
It had only about two hundred fifty

351
00:12:52,019 --> 00:12:54,489
test miles and had never been registered

352
00:12:54,489 --> 00:12:55,291
for the road.

353
00:12:55,471 --> 00:12:58,074
duPont Registry reported that the price was

354
00:12:58,074 --> 00:13:00,676
about six hundred thousand dollars over its

355
00:13:00,676 --> 00:13:01,160
sticker.

356
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,924
Then came the most extreme case.

357
00:13:04,104 --> 00:13:05,685
The Chiron Profilee,

358
00:13:05,685 --> 00:13:06,791
a one-off car,

359
00:13:06,791 --> 00:13:09,319
sold at RM Sotheby's in Paris in

360
00:13:09,319 --> 00:13:13,348
February twenty twenty-three for nine million seven

361
00:13:13,348 --> 00:13:17,061
hundred ninety-two thousand five hundred euros.

362
00:13:17,241 --> 00:13:20,169
Hagerty reported it was the most valuable

363
00:13:20,169 --> 00:13:22,241
new car ever sold at auction,

364
00:13:22,241 --> 00:13:24,883
beating the previous record held by a

365
00:13:24,883 --> 00:13:26,669
Ferrari LaFerrari Aperta.

366
00:13:27,019 --> 00:13:28,760
Why did prices rise?

367
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:31,053
Because supply was fixed.

368
00:13:31,233 --> 00:13:34,635
Bugatti built five hundred Chirons and stopped.

369
00:13:34,815 --> 00:13:37,816
The last base-spec Chiron was built in

370
00:13:37,816 --> 00:13:40,186
September twenty twenty-three,

371
00:13:40,186 --> 00:13:43,346
and the five hundredth and final Chiron,

372
00:13:43,346 --> 00:13:45,320
the Super Sport L'Ultime,

373
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:48,480
left Molsheim in May twenty twenty-four.

374
00:13:48,660 --> 00:13:51,533
The W16 is now gone from new

375
00:13:51,533 --> 00:13:52,456
Bugattis.

376
00:13:52,807 --> 00:13:54,780
And the successor costs more.

377
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,694
The Bugatti Tourbillon,

378
00:13:56,694 --> 00:13:59,409
revealed in June twenty twenty-four,

379
00:13:59,409 --> 00:14:02,123
is priced at about three point eight

380
00:14:02,123 --> 00:14:04,159
million euros before taxes,

381
00:14:04,159 --> 00:14:08,080
with first deliveries expected in twenty twenty-six.

382
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:10,756
When the new car costs more than

383
00:14:10,756 --> 00:14:11,692
the old one,

384
00:14:11,692 --> 00:14:14,033
the old one tends to look like

385
00:14:14,033 --> 00:14:16,607
a better deal on the used market.

386
00:14:16,957 --> 00:14:18,361
But here is the twist.

387
00:14:18,541 --> 00:14:20,817
Resale gains are not guaranteed.

388
00:14:20,997 --> 00:14:23,532
The cars that rose the most were

389
00:14:23,532 --> 00:14:26,384
early, low-mileage, or one-off cars.

390
00:14:26,564 --> 00:14:28,846
A Chiron that has been driven,

391
00:14:28,846 --> 00:14:31,584
damaged, or poorly serviced can be a

392
00:14:31,584 --> 00:14:33,182
very different story.

393
00:14:33,362 --> 00:14:35,195
And every year of service,

394
00:14:35,195 --> 00:14:38,157
insurance, and storage eats into any gain.

395
00:14:38,507 --> 00:14:40,387
Now flip the question around.

396
00:14:40,567 --> 00:14:42,762
What did these cars cost the company

397
00:14:42,762 --> 00:14:43,737
that built them?

398
00:14:43,917 --> 00:14:45,045
With the Veyron,

399
00:14:45,045 --> 00:14:46,738
the answer was shocking.

400
00:14:46,918 --> 00:14:49,277
In October twenty thirteen,

401
00:14:49,277 --> 00:14:52,860
evo reported an estimate from analysts at

402
00:14:52,860 --> 00:14:53,733
Sanford C.

403
00:14:53,913 --> 00:14:54,761
Bernstein.

404
00:14:54,941 --> 00:14:58,202
They calculated that Volkswagen lost about three

405
00:14:58,202 --> 00:15:00,987
point nine million pounds on every Veyron

406
00:15:00,987 --> 00:15:03,433
sold, and about one point four three

407
00:15:03,433 --> 00:15:05,947
billion pounds on the Veyron overall.

408
00:15:06,297 --> 00:15:09,955
That estimate spreads the huge development cost

409
00:15:09,955 --> 00:15:12,135
over a small number of cars,

410
00:15:12,135 --> 00:15:14,003
so it is not the same as

411
00:15:14,003 --> 00:15:16,571
losing money on each car's parts.

412
00:15:16,751 --> 00:15:18,261
But the message was clear.

413
00:15:18,441 --> 00:15:20,295
The Veyron was a statement,

414
00:15:20,295 --> 00:15:22,356
paid for by one of the largest

415
00:15:22,356 --> 00:15:24,211
car companies in the world.

416
00:15:24,391 --> 00:15:26,449
Bugatti had to make the next car

417
00:15:26,449 --> 00:15:27,607
a better business.

418
00:15:27,957 --> 00:15:30,174
The Chiron's plan looked different.

419
00:15:30,354 --> 00:15:33,240
Higher prices, a higher production limit of

420
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,448
five hundred cars,

421
00:15:34,448 --> 00:15:36,796
and a long list of special versions

422
00:15:36,796 --> 00:15:39,212
and one-offs that sold for much more

423
00:15:39,212 --> 00:15:40,420
than the base car.

424
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,377
That is why there were so many

425
00:15:42,377 --> 00:15:42,910
versions.

426
00:15:43,090 --> 00:15:45,277
Every variant was a way to sell

427
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,816
the same engineering at a new price.

428
00:15:48,166 --> 00:15:49,478
Here is the twist.

429
00:15:49,658 --> 00:15:52,361
Some of the most valuable Chirons were

430
00:15:52,361 --> 00:15:54,708
the ones Bugatti built only once.

431
00:15:54,888 --> 00:15:57,540
The Profilee was meant as a small

432
00:15:57,540 --> 00:16:00,996
production run, but Bugatti built only one,

433
00:16:00,996 --> 00:16:03,728
and it sold for nearly ten million

434
00:16:03,728 --> 00:16:04,211
euros.

435
00:16:04,391 --> 00:16:05,974
The La Voiture Noire,

436
00:16:05,974 --> 00:16:09,216
a one-off inspired by the nineteen thirties

437
00:16:09,216 --> 00:16:11,477
Type fifty-seven S C Atlantic,

438
00:16:11,477 --> 00:16:14,191
was reported sold for about nine and

439
00:16:14,191 --> 00:16:15,850
a half million pounds.

440
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:19,542
Exclusivity turned into the most profitable product

441
00:16:19,542 --> 00:16:20,024
of all.

442
00:16:20,374 --> 00:16:22,252
Let's try one more way to see

443
00:16:22,252 --> 00:16:24,843
the cost, with a clearly simple example.

444
00:16:25,023 --> 00:16:27,779
Say an owner drives one thousand miles

445
00:16:27,779 --> 00:16:30,751
a year, pays about forty thousand dollars

446
00:16:30,751 --> 00:16:32,274
a year for insurance,

447
00:16:32,274 --> 00:16:35,174
and eleven thousand five hundred for the

448
00:16:35,174 --> 00:16:36,262
annual service.

449
00:16:36,442 --> 00:16:39,107
Those numbers come from the estimates we

450
00:16:39,107 --> 00:16:41,972
showed, and the total is fifty-one thousand

451
00:16:41,972 --> 00:16:43,837
five hundred dollars a year.

452
00:16:44,188 --> 00:16:46,800
Spread over one thousand miles,

453
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:50,255
that is about fifty-one dollars per mile,

454
00:16:50,255 --> 00:16:52,025
before brakes, tires,

455
00:16:52,025 --> 00:16:53,963
storage, or any repair.

456
00:16:54,143 --> 00:16:56,895
A ten-mile drive to dinner would cost

457
00:16:56,895 --> 00:16:59,943
about five hundred dollars in fixed costs

458
00:16:59,943 --> 00:17:00,389
alone.

459
00:17:00,569 --> 00:17:02,920
That is our own calculation from the

460
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,356
figures in this video,

461
00:17:04,356 --> 00:17:05,858
not an official number,

462
00:17:05,858 --> 00:17:07,882
but it shows why so many owners

463
00:17:07,882 --> 00:17:08,731
barely drive.

464
00:17:09,081 --> 00:17:10,590
And here is the twist.

465
00:17:10,770 --> 00:17:12,042
The less you drive,

466
00:17:12,042 --> 00:17:14,519
the higher the cost per mile becomes,

467
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:17,264
because the insurance and the service are

468
00:17:17,264 --> 00:17:17,933
still due.

469
00:17:18,113 --> 00:17:20,726
An owner who drives only one hundred

470
00:17:20,726 --> 00:17:23,048
miles a year would pay more than

471
00:17:23,048 --> 00:17:25,805
five hundred dollars per mile in fixed

472
00:17:25,805 --> 00:17:26,240
costs.

473
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,388
In other words,

474
00:17:27,388 --> 00:17:29,775
keeping a Chiron parked does not make

475
00:17:29,775 --> 00:17:30,356
it cheap.

476
00:17:30,536 --> 00:17:33,218
It makes every mile more expensive.

477
00:17:33,568 --> 00:17:36,732
That math also explains why some owners

478
00:17:36,732 --> 00:17:39,652
do the opposite and drive their cars

479
00:17:39,652 --> 00:17:40,139
a lot.

480
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:42,724
If the fixed costs are the same,

481
00:17:42,724 --> 00:17:45,429
using the car spreads them over more

482
00:17:45,429 --> 00:17:45,880
miles.

483
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:48,568
The trade-off is resale value.

484
00:17:48,748 --> 00:17:51,843
More miles usually means a lower price

485
00:17:51,843 --> 00:17:53,554
when the car is sold,

486
00:17:53,554 --> 00:17:56,241
so every owner has to decide what

487
00:17:56,241 --> 00:17:57,463
the car is for,

488
00:17:57,463 --> 00:17:59,092
a drive or an asset.

489
00:17:59,443 --> 00:18:02,192
One decision shapes the whole cost of

490
00:18:02,192 --> 00:18:04,644
ownership, the extended warranty.

491
00:18:04,824 --> 00:18:06,229
Remember the numbers.

492
00:18:06,409 --> 00:18:09,339
About two hundred four thousand dollars for

493
00:18:09,339 --> 00:18:12,473
an extra four years of bumper-to-bumper cover,

494
00:18:12,473 --> 00:18:15,404
against a replacement engine at about eight

495
00:18:15,404 --> 00:18:18,674
hundred fifty-six thousand dollars and a gearbox

496
00:18:18,674 --> 00:18:21,537
at about one hundred eighty-five thousand.

497
00:18:21,887 --> 00:18:23,574
If nothing major breaks,

498
00:18:23,574 --> 00:18:25,613
the warranty looks expensive.

499
00:18:25,793 --> 00:18:27,567
If one big part fails,

500
00:18:27,567 --> 00:18:30,228
it pays for itself several times.

501
00:18:30,408 --> 00:18:32,840
And there is another reason owners buy

502
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:33,032
it.

503
00:18:33,212 --> 00:18:35,920
A Chiron with a full factory history

504
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:38,553
and an active warranty is easier to

505
00:18:38,553 --> 00:18:41,110
sell, and buyers at this level pay

506
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:42,164
for certainty.

507
00:18:42,514 --> 00:18:45,016
So the real cost of ownership depends

508
00:18:45,016 --> 00:18:47,181
on choices more than on the car.

509
00:18:47,361 --> 00:18:48,633
How much you drive,

510
00:18:48,633 --> 00:18:49,839
how you insure it,

511
00:18:49,839 --> 00:18:51,781
whether you buy the warranty,

512
00:18:51,781 --> 00:18:53,723
and whether you plan to sell.

513
00:18:53,903 --> 00:18:56,143
Two owners with the same Chiron can

514
00:18:56,143 --> 00:18:58,640
end up with completely different bills.

515
00:18:58,990 --> 00:19:00,703
So let's put it together,

516
00:19:00,703 --> 00:19:03,239
using only the numbers we have shown.

517
00:19:03,419 --> 00:19:05,678
A base Chiron in America had a

518
00:19:05,678 --> 00:19:08,689
sticker of roughly three point one seven

519
00:19:08,689 --> 00:19:11,023
million dollars before options.

520
00:19:11,203 --> 00:19:14,739
Insurance estimates range from about thirty-six thousand

521
00:19:14,739 --> 00:19:16,823
to fifty thousand dollars a year.

522
00:19:17,003 --> 00:19:20,059
Annual service is about eleven thousand five

523
00:19:20,059 --> 00:19:22,699
hundred, with a major service of about

524
00:19:22,699 --> 00:19:25,339
thirty-four thousand every four years.

525
00:19:25,689 --> 00:19:28,155
If you add an extended warranty at

526
00:19:28,155 --> 00:19:30,041
two hundred four thousand,

527
00:19:30,041 --> 00:19:32,724
and wear items like brakes and tires,

528
00:19:32,724 --> 00:19:35,626
a careful owner can easily spend several

529
00:19:35,626 --> 00:19:38,527
hundred thousand dollars over ten years,

530
00:19:38,527 --> 00:19:40,340
on top of the car itself.

531
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:42,726
Fuel is a tiny part of it.

532
00:19:42,906 --> 00:19:45,971
Insurance and service are the big parts.

533
00:19:46,322 --> 00:19:48,081
And then, for many owners,

534
00:19:48,081 --> 00:19:49,839
the market paid them back.

535
00:19:50,019 --> 00:19:52,283
That is the strange truth about the

536
00:19:52,283 --> 00:19:52,736
Chiron.

537
00:19:52,916 --> 00:19:55,139
It is one of the most expensive

538
00:19:55,139 --> 00:19:56,717
cars on earth to keep,

539
00:19:56,717 --> 00:19:58,653
and also one of the few new

540
00:19:58,653 --> 00:20:01,234
cars that many owners could sell for

541
00:20:01,234 --> 00:20:02,669
more than they paid.

542
00:20:03,019 --> 00:20:04,985
Which is why the real cost of

543
00:20:04,985 --> 00:20:06,815
a Chiron is not just money.

544
00:20:06,995 --> 00:20:08,365
It is access.

545
00:20:08,545 --> 00:20:09,928
You needed the money,

546
00:20:09,928 --> 00:20:11,904
the speed to get a build slot,

547
00:20:11,904 --> 00:20:13,287
the patience to wait,

548
00:20:13,287 --> 00:20:15,790
and the discipline to keep it perfect.

549
00:20:15,970 --> 00:20:17,932
That is what you were really buying.

550
00:20:18,282 --> 00:20:19,825
Tell us in the comments:

551
00:20:19,825 --> 00:20:21,884
if someone gave you a Chiron but

552
00:20:21,884 --> 00:20:23,556
you had to pay to keep it,

553
00:20:23,556 --> 00:20:25,422
would you keep it or sell it?

554
00:20:25,602 --> 00:20:27,872
And watch the other videos in this

555
00:20:27,872 --> 00:20:28,806
Chiron series.

