00:20:28,986 --> 00:20:31,500
Two facts most people don't know about

557
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:33,881
the car, how it really compares with

558
00:20:33,881 --> 00:20:35,270
the Koenigsegg Jesko,

559
00:20:35,270 --> 00:20:37,122
and the full story of how it

560
00:20:37,122 --> 00:20:37,717
was made.

